#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:214
msgid ""
"Small images stay sharp, and the lasso shows the selection while it is drawn."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:220
msgid "Add a user guide, available from the main menu or with F1."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:225
msgid "The first public version of Pigoune."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:227
msgid ""
"Import SVG, PNG, JPEG, WebP, GIF and ICO files, or whole folders, with "
